      "content": "i hear you but the wait times at the hospital are insane and i'm literally just sitting here feeling fine now. if i were to just take an extra dose of aspirin or something to help with the pressure, would that be okay? or should i just wait until tomorrow morning to see if it's still there? it really doesn't feel like an emergency.",
